ies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Operating System Info\r\n\r\nWindows 10 / Windows 11\r\n\r\n### Other OS\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### OBS Studio Version\r\n\r\n27.2.4 / 28.0.3 / 28.1.2 / 29.0.2 / 29.1.3\r\n\r\n### OBS Studio Version (Other)\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### OBS Studio Log URL\r\n\r\nhttps://obsproject.com/logs/2_AMgGQimthwixzU\r\n\r\n### OBS Studio Crash Log URL\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n\r\nStream keys are retained.\r\n\r\n### Current Behavior\r\n\r\nStream keys are not saved.\r\n\r\n### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Tools -> Auto-Configuration Wizard\r\n2. Select \"Optimize for streaming, recording is secondary\"\r\n3. Video Settings (Next)\r\n4. Select the service \"YouTube - RTMPS” or \"YouTube - HLS”\r\n5. Select \"Use Stream Key (advanced)\"\r\n6. Enter stream key\r\n7. Wait for it to end.\r\n8. Apply Settings\r\n9. Start Streaming\r\n10. \"Missing Stream Setup\" is displayed.\r\n11. Open Setting -> Stream\r\n12. Stream key is not saved. (The screen is not set to the stream key screen in the first place.)\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1337354/166138920-eef8dc0b-c220-4de5-8c77-59450d13878a.mp4\r\n\r\nWhen I found the problem with the auto configuration wizard I also found the following problem Could they be related? (Do I need to open another issue?)\r\n1. Open Setting -> Stream\r\n2. Select the service \"YouTube - RTMPS” or \"YouTube - HLS”\r\n3. Select \"Use Stream Key (advanced)\"\r\n4. Enter stream key\r\n5. Save the settings and close the settings window.\r\n6. Open Setting -> Stream\r\n7. The screen is not the screen that displays the stream key, but the screen that appears when you first select \"Youtube -RTMPS\". (the stream key is saved)\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1337354/166138941-507d1484-78d6-4373-a37b-713fa312bfb6.mp4\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else we should know?\r\n\r\nI'm using translation. Sorry if the English is not correct. \r\n\r\nPerhaps this has occurred since the YouTube integration feature was implemented.","closed_by":{"login":"Lain-B","id":134130700,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_6sDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134130700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Lain-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lain-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/issues/6406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/issues/6406/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}